  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.5, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.7"
  description: "Each of the nine ordered families carries an exclusive bound at both ends, and each field holds a value strictly between them. An exclusive bound excludes only its own value, so every one is admitted."
